Date:   Thu Jan 21 16:42:34 2021 +0000

    Fix some fuzz issues in CRAM 3.1.

    Credit to OSS-Fuzz

    - Check for return value from RANS4x16 and ARITH codecs so a valid
      stream that is the wrong size still frees up the memory.
      Fixes oss-fuzz 29786
      Fixes oss-fuzz 29787
      Fixes oss-fuzz 29796

    - Check for return value from TOK3 codec so error is bubbled up
      Fixes oss-fuzz 29789

